  "body": "Affordable. Stylish. Smart buying.\r\nFeaturing 3 Bedrooms and 2.5 Bathrooms\r\n\r\nStep onto the property ladder with this contemporary freehold terrace in the heart of Stanmore Bay - the perfect match for first-home buyers, young families, or busy professionals chasing low-maintenance modern living.\r\n\r\nDesigned for today's lifestyle, the light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area flows effortlessly to your private outdoor deck - ideal for summer BBQs, entertaining friends, or simply unwinding after work. The sleek designer kitchen comes complete with premium SMEG appliances, adding a touch of luxury to everyday living.\r\n\r\nDownstairs also features a versatile bedroom plus a convenient guest toilet - perfect for flatmates, guests, or working from home.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you'll find two further bedrooms including a stylish master retreat with its own ensuite, while the fully tiled family bathroom services the rest of the home with ease and sophistication.\r\n\r\nAnd the location? Hard to beat.\r\n\r\nJust moments from Stanmore Bay Village, stunning beaches, cafes, schools, and everyday amenities. With the upcoming Penlink connection set to transform commuting convenience, this is an area with exciting future growth potential.\r\n\r\nPlus - Snowplanet is practically on your doorstep. While others travel hours for adventure, you're only minutes away.\r\n\r\nAffordable opportunities like this don't last long.\r\n\r\nThe annal levy is $512.06 as of year 2026.\r\n\r\nCall Grace & Johnny today - before someone else beats you to it.",
